{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0284_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b03eba5d0295b1c1908a3e52134c36e4bacf9a8573cf3375c4b72065751e6801", "ja": "（今日は千早とサーキット場のイベントに来ている。\n午前はレースクイーンの仕事、午後はライブの予定だ）", "zh": "（今天和千早一起来到了赛车场的活动现场。上午是赛车女郎的工作，下午计划举办演唱会。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0284_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "3299a75c4ee4c509fcee8496c3a3f79b61493cf85326c78a848344e642038599", "ja": "お疲れ様です、{$P$}。\nよければ、これを。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。如果不介意的话，请收下这个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0284_1002_p", "source_sha256": "635390d4fec5185e5e4f44e896d7c254fbb9e13ee44d31369abd9fdd74bf1aea", "ja": "おっ、スポーツドリンクか。助かるよ。\n暑くて、ちょうど喉がカラカラだったんだ。", "zh": "哦，是运动饮料啊。帮大忙了。\n天气太热，正好嗓子都渴干了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0284_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "4afa6c8d227ec3adeab771e7f612676e9ea186388a991f50009559630c84f0c2", "ja": "それなら良かったです。\nタオルもありますから、必要なら言ってください。", "zh": "那就好。\n还有毛巾，需要的话请告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0284_1004_p", "source_sha256": "500c1a86015810e4cf31249eb50a5c5b2179960028edced957d40853393178cd", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう。\nふう、なんだか、いたれりつくせりって感じだな。", "zh": "啊，谢谢。\n呼，总觉得真是照顾得无微不至啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0284_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "6ec85ca397374f1e61a44f1431df77305b5579604161865b237050956272be11", "ja": "ふふ、今日の私は、チームの皆さんを支える\nレースクイーンですから。これくらいは。", "zh": "呵呵，今天的我可是负责支持团队各位的赛车女郎。这点小事还是做得到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0284_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "f39af226b0e4bc9b57a1e64765b2b02c471bceb3ee393a677b6468251452079f", "ja": "チームメンバーが全力で動けるように、\n体調を気遣うのも大切なお仕事です。", "zh": "为了让团队成员能够全力以赴，关心他们的身体状况也是很重要的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0284_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f22829f0454d891fae2783df15cb2677d040e843e28cee22d7eda15fa2a59745", "ja": "ははっ、流石だな。でも、くれぐれも頑張りすぎには\n注意してくれよ。この後、ライブも控えてるんだから。", "zh": "哈哈，不愧是你。不过，千万要注意别太拼了。毕竟接下来还有演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0284_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "8fc841e8610e1cbeca88d8c06747c5177eef0bf5ae59049920492509a3c1cd13", "ja": "わかりました、気を付けます。\n……ですが、もう少しだけやらせてください。", "zh": "我明白了，会注意的。\n……不过，请让我再练一会儿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0284_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "7cb8f9de8cdaa7dfc161f5486d0d79834eea77f835f2660e4dba16c6e1f586c1", "ja": "皆さんの心に届く歌を歌うためにも、\n今のうちに会場の空気を掴んでおきたいんです。", "zh": "为了唱出能够传达给大家心中的歌，\n我想趁现在先掌握一下现场的气氛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0284_1010_p", "source_sha256": "db6b9f6574f35c4da7b8fc2d7466cf49d7de5af42c651a8807c463247822214b", "ja": "なるほど、そういう目的なら千早に任せるよ。\nでも、仕事に戻る前に……。", "zh": "原来如此，如果是为了这个目的，就交给千早吧。\n不过，在回去工作之前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0284_1011", "source_sha256": "28d3f1f1cb0f4be1982d59d681adb96baf11ccaf6e3edfcce7c302e688c8d20e", "ja": "ドリンクをわたす", "zh": "赠送饮料", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0284_2000_002chi", "source_sha256": "d2dfc97ba5a135b825156636b5128398584c934c198b4b8bde7ac22c739fdeb9", "ja": "え？　えっと……", "zh": "诶？那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0284_2001_p", "source_sha256": "0bd5fbe82f0a04f833cece11d12d705be92f178f81633eb140f5603aca72366e", "ja": "それを飲んで少し休憩すること。\n千早、さっきから全然休憩とれてないだろ？", "zh": "喝了它休息一会儿。\n千早，你从刚才开始就完全没休息吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0284_2002_002chi", "source_sha256": "bd725a6cee53af44c304628db8db817b451ed8700986f5b1c8d1bfe2b54fc448", "ja": "あっ……そうですね。言われてみれば。\nありがとうございます、いただきます。", "zh": "啊……是呢。仔细想想确实如此。\n谢谢您，我就收下了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0284_2003_002chi", "source_sha256": "a3188bfb1fcf45472a938e6851c9de8b1a046d324ee5f60ad268350a71864e7f", "ja": "ふぅ、ダメですね、私。まだまだ\n{$P$}に面倒をかけてばかりで。", "zh": "呼……我还真是不行啊。总是给{$P$}添麻烦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0284_2004_p", "source_sha256": "420b0c9022ae533fe6a9a1edd1a9ef83c6eb797fc6e9356f3a72ecbd893d00b0", "ja": "はは、そんなこともないけどな。それに、まったく\n手がかからないのも、それはそれで寂しい気がするし。", "zh": "哈哈，也没到那种程度。而且，要是一点都不需要我费心，反而会觉得有点寂寞呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0284_2005_002chi", "source_sha256": "ba7968151a003ada058ed8f0c4b7c9c8c56dd1b6e91a20011efe7b32b2671ccf", "ja": "ふふっ、なんですかそれ。\n……でも、そうですね。", "zh": "呵呵，那倒也不是。而且，完全不用费心照顾的话，感觉也会有点寂寞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0284_2006_002chi", "source_sha256": "f21a7120df4fe3e98a69a078db44f227d2071e0dfa549829804daac64e558433", "ja": "仲間を頼るのは、\n別に恥ずかしいことじゃありませんよね。", "zh": "依靠伙伴，并不是什么丢脸的事，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0284_2007_002chi", "source_sha256": "21c7a785123f842cd9a98c60bbc13bc9df1ece543ab06d4aaa290185d51189f8", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがとうございます。\nチームの一員として、この後も頑張ります。", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢您。\n作为团队的一员，接下来我也会继续努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
